   "stem": {
      "text": "Find the exact value of \\( \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{2}{n(n+2)} \\)."
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": [
         "Rational",
         3,
         2
      ]
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Partial fractions give \\( \\frac{2}{n(n+2)} = \\frac{1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n+2} \\), so the series telescopes.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Add",
            [
               "Divide",
               1,
               "n"
            ],
            [
               "Negate",
               [
                  "Divide",
                  1,
                  [
                     "Add",
                     "n",
                     2
                  ]
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Writing out the terms from \\( n = 1 \\) to \\( n = N \\), the inner terms cancel and the partial sum is \\( S_N = \\frac{3}{2} - \\frac{1}{N + 2} - \\frac{1}{N + 1} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Add",
            [
               "Rational",
               3,
               2
            ],
            [
               "Negate",
               [
                  "Divide",
                  1,
                  [
                     "Add",
                     "N",
                     1
                  ]
               ]
            ],
            [
               "Negate",
               [
                  "Divide",
                  1,
                  [
                     "Add",
                     "N",
                     2
                  ]
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "As \\( N \\to \\infty \\), the terms containing \\( N \\) approach their limits, so \\( \\lim_{N \\to \\infty} S_N = \\frac{3}{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            3,
            2
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "The value of the series is \\( \\frac{3}{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            3,
            2
         ]
      }
   ],
